{"seq":1,"slug":"generative-modeling","title":"生成式建模概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-models/foundations/generative-modeling","wordCount":2087,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"生成式建模概览\">生成式建模概览</h1><p>生成模型要做的事可以用一句话概括：给定一堆样本（比如一百万张猫的照片），学出它们背后那个看不见的概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{data}}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，然后能从这个分布里采出全新的、以前没见过却同样&quot;像猫&quot;的样本。难点在于，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 往往是几十万维的（一张 512×512 的 RGB 图就有近八十万个数），这个分布的形状极其复杂，没有任何解析表达式可写。过去十年里，研究者提出了四五种截然不同的逼近策略，扩散模型是 2020 年代最成功的一支；而 2025 年之后，自回归又借多模态大模型东山再起，版图再度生变。理解这些策略各自的取舍，是看懂这场变迁的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四个评价维度与五条技术路线\">核心概念：四个评价维度与五条技术路线</h2><p>衡量一个生成模型范式，业界通常看四个相互掣肘的维度：<strong>似然是否可算</strong>（能否精确给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，这对异常检测、压缩很重要）、<strong>采样是否快</strong>（生成一个样本要几次网络前向）、<strong>训练是否稳定</strong>（会不会崩溃、需不需要小心调参）、<strong>样本质量是否高</strong>（生成的图清不清晰、多不多样）。没有一种范式能在四个维度上同时拿满分，每条路线都是一组妥协。</p>\n<p>下面这张图勾勒出主流路线如何从同一个目标分叉：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[数据分布 p_data x&lt;br/&gt;高维 复杂 无解析式] --&gt; B{如何建模?}&#10;    B --&gt;|显式 近似似然| C[VAE&lt;br/&gt;变分下界 ELBO]&#10;    B --&gt;|显式 精确似然| D[归一化流&lt;br/&gt;可逆变换]&#10;    B --&gt;|显式 逐元素分解| E[自回归&lt;br/&gt;链式法则]&#10;    B --&gt;|隐式 对抗博弈| F[GAN&lt;br/&gt;生成器 vs 判别器]&#10;    B --&gt;|多步去噪| G[扩散模型&lt;br/&gt;加噪 逆转加噪]&#10;    C --&gt; H[采样快 但样本偏糊]&#10;    D --&gt; I[似然精确 但表达受限]&#10;    E --&gt; J[似然精确 但采样极慢]&#10;    F --&gt; K[样本锐利 但训练易崩]&#10;    G --&gt; L[质量高且训练稳&lt;br/&gt;代价 采样多步]\">flowchart TD\n    A[数据分布 p_data x&lt;br/&gt;高维 复杂 无解析式] --&gt; B{如何建模?}\n    B --&gt;|显式 近似似然| C[VAE&lt;br/&gt;变分下界 ELBO]\n    B --&gt;|显式 精确似然| D[归一化流&lt;br/&gt;可逆变换]\n    B --&gt;|显式 逐元素分解| E[自回归&lt;br/&gt;链式法则]\n    B --&gt;|隐式 对抗博弈| F[GAN&lt;br/&gt;生成器 vs 判别器]\n    B --&gt;|多步去噪| G[扩散模型&lt;br/&gt;加噪 逆转加噪]\n    C --&gt; H[采样快 但样本偏糊]\n    D --&gt; I[似然精确 但表达受限]\n    E --&gt; J[似然精确 但采样极慢]\n    F --&gt; K[样本锐利 但训练易崩]\n    G --&gt; L[质量高且训练稳&lt;br/&gt;代价 采样多步]</pre><p>五条路线的核心权衡对比如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>似然</th>\n<th>采样速度</th>\n<th>训练稳定性</th>\n<th>样本质量</th>\n<th>代表工作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VAE</td>\n<td>近似（下界）</td>\n<td>快（1 步）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中（偏模糊）</td>\n<td>VAE, VQ-VAE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归一化流</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>RealNVP, Glow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自回归</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>慢（逐元素）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>PixelCNN, ImageGPT；今以 LLM 原生多模态形态回归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GAN</td>\n<td>不可算</td>\n<td>快（1 步）</td>\n<td>低（易崩/模式崩塌）</td>\n<td>高（锐利）</td>\n<td>StyleGAN, BigGAN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩散</td>\n<td>近似（下界）</td>\n<td>慢（多步，可加速）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>DDPM, Stable Diffusion</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"变分自编码器-用下界换可算性\">变分自编码器：用下界换可算性</h2><p>VAE 的思路是引入一个低维隐变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>，假设数据由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 经解码器生成：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_\\theta(x) = \\int p_\\theta(x|z)p(z)\\,dz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>。这个积分算不动，于是 VAE 退而求其次，优化它的一个下界——证据下界（ELBO）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log p_\\theta(x) \\ge \\mathbb{E}_{q_\\phi(z|x)}[\\log p_\\theta(x|z)] - D_{\\text{KL}}(q_\\phi(z|x)\\,\\|\\,p(z))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1333em;vertical-align:-0.3833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3833em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">KL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一项要求重建得像，第二项把后验拉向先验。VAE 训练稳、采样只需一次解码器前向，但因为优化的是下界且后验假设过简，生成图往往偏糊。值得记住的是：扩散模型的训练目标本质上也是一个变分下界，只不过把&quot;一步隐变量&quot;换成了&quot;几百步的加噪链&quot;，这个联系在<a href=\"ddpm\">去噪扩散概率模型 DDPM</a> 里会推导清楚。VAE 那个把数据压到低维潜空间的解码器思路，也直接被<a href=\"../architectures/latent-diffusion\">潜在扩散与 LDM</a> 借用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gan-与归一化流-锐利与精确的两个极端\">GAN 与归一化流：锐利与精确的两个极端</h2><p>GAN 走的是另一条完全不显式建模似然的路：一个生成器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 把噪声映射成图，一个判别器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 努力分辨真假，两者对抗。训练目标是一个极小极大博弈：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>G</mi></munder><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>D</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_G \\max_D \\; \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim p_{\\text{data}}}[\\log D(x)] + \\mathbb{E}_{z \\sim p_z}[\\log(1 - D(G(z)))]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4943em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)))]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>GAN 采样只要一次前向，样本极其锐利，曾是 2018 到 2021 年的图像生成王者（StyleGAN 的人脸至今仍是标杆）。但它的训练像走钢丝：判别器太强生成器学不动，太弱又给不了有效信号，还容易陷入模式崩塌（只会生成几种样本）。扩散模型正是凭借训练稳定这一点把 GAN 拉下马的——它不用对抗，只做回归。有意思的是，对抗思想后来又以&quot;对抗蒸馏&quot;的形式回到扩散里，用于把多步压成一步，详见<a href=\"../sampling/distillation-fewstep\">蒸馏与少步采样</a>。</p>\n<p>归一化流则坚持精确似然：它用一串可逆变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 把简单分布（高斯）映射成数据分布，利用变量替换公式精确计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log p(x) = \\log p(z) + \\log|\\det \\partial f/\\partial x|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">det</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。代价是每层变换都必须可逆且雅可比行列式好算，这严重限制了网络的表达力。流匹配（flow matching）某种意义上继承了&quot;流&quot;的几何直觉，却抛掉了可逆性的枷锁，这条线索在<a href=\"score-based-sde\">基于分数的生成与 SDE</a> 里展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扩散为何后来居上-以及-2025-年后的双路线变局\">扩散为何后来居上，以及 2025 年后的双路线变局</h2><p>扩散模型把生成拆成几百个微小步骤：前向过程慢慢往图里加高斯噪声直到变成纯噪声，反向过程学一个网络逐步去噪。这个设计带来三个关键优势。其一，<strong>训练极稳</strong>——本质上是个去噪回归任务，没有对抗博弈，损失曲线平滑可预测。其二，<strong>样本质量与多样性兼得</strong>——多步细化让模型有充分机会修正细节，又不像 GAN 那样为追求逼真牺牲多样性。其三，<strong>天然支持条件控制</strong>——在每一步去噪里注入文本、边缘图等条件极其自然，这正是文生图爆发的技术前提，机制见<a href=\"../architectures/conditioning-guidance\">条件控制与引导</a>。</p>\n<p>唯一的硬伤是采样慢：原始 DDPM 要一千步。但这恰恰是一个工程问题而非原理缺陷——整个<a href=\"../sampling/\">采样与加速</a> 章节就是在解决它，从 DDIM 的二十步到一致性模型的一步，速度问题已被基本攻克。当一个范式同时拿下了训练稳定、质量、多样性、可控性，而唯一的短板又能靠工程补上时，它主导开源与专业创作工具链就只是时间问题了。</p>\n<p>不过，&quot;自回归因慢而出局&quot;这个结论在 2025—2026 年必须重新表述。像素级自回归确实又慢又贵，但大语言模型的原生多模态化改变了算账方式：OpenAI 于 2025 年 3 月为 GPT-4o 上线原生图像生成（官方公告 <em>Introducing 4o Image Generation</em>），Google 于同年 8 月推出 Gemini 2.5 Flash Image（社区俗称 Nano Banana，其后又有更强版本迭代）——它们把图像当作统一词表里的另一种 token 序列，由同一个自回归主干直接产出。逐 token 解码的单图成本仍高于蒸馏后的扩散模型，却换来三样扩散流水线不易复刻的东西：文本与图像在同一模型内无缝混排、&quot;对话式&quot;多轮迭代编辑、以及把世界知识直接带进生成的指令遵循。于是到 2026 年，图像生成呈现<strong>双路线并存</strong>：扩散系凭开源生态、可控管线与成熟加速方案占据专业创作与部署侧；原生多模态自回归系则借旗舰产品之力主导通用助手与轻量编辑场景。两条路线还在互相渗透——开源侧出现了腾讯混元 HunyuanImage 3.0 这类以 MoE 自回归为主干的图像模型（见<a href=\"../applications/text-to-image\">文生图系统</a>），不少新旗舰则在自回归骨架外接扩散解码头。&quot;哪个范式统治&quot;已是伪问题，真问题是&quot;哪条路线匹配你的场景约束&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生成建模的目标是学出高维数据分布并能采样；四个掣肘维度是似然可算性、采样速度、训练稳定性、样本质量。</li>\n<li>VAE 用变分下界换可算与稳定，代价是样本偏糊；它的潜空间思想被潜在扩散继承。</li>\n<li>GAN 用对抗博弈换锐利样本，代价是训练不稳；归一化流用可逆变换换精确似然，代价是表达受限。</li>\n<li>扩散模型用多步去噪同时拿下训练稳定、质量、多样性、可控性，唯一短板采样慢可由工程加速补上。</li>\n<li>2025 年起 LLM 原生多模态让自回归图像生成重回牌桌，图像生成进入扩散系与原生多模态自回归系并存的阶段，且两条路线正互相渗透。</li>\n<li>这套坐标系是阅读全 hub 的基础：后续每一章都在填补扩散这五维妥协里的某个格子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生成式建模概览","id":"生成式建模概览"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四个评价维度与五条技术路线","id":"核心概念-四个评价维度与五条技术路线"},{"level":2,"text":"变分自编码器：用下界换可算性","id":"变分自编码器-用下界换可算性"},{"level":2,"text":"GAN 与归一化流：锐利与精确的两个极端","id":"gan-与归一化流-锐利与精确的两个极端"},{"level":2,"text":"扩散为何后来居上，以及 2025 年后的双路线变局","id":"扩散为何后来居上-以及-2025-年后的双路线变局"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"去噪扩散概率模型 DDPM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-models/foundations/ddpm"}}